1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,974
What happens when a
ruler can live for

2
00:00:01,994 --> 00:00:03,387
ten thousand years?

3
00:00:03,407 --> 00:00:04,741
Meet the Undying
Queen.

4
00:00:04,761 --> 00:00:05,974
She never ages.

5
00:00:05,994 --> 00:00:07,951
The lazy version:
she's immortal,

6
00:00:07,971 --> 00:00:09,454
and nothing else
changes.

7
00:00:09,474 --> 00:00:10,463
Press run.

8
00:00:10,483 --> 00:00:11,694
A thousand years.

9
00:00:11,714 --> 00:00:13,965
Forty generations
wait for her crown.

10
00:00:13,985 --> 00:00:14,765
Forty heirs.

11
00:00:14,785 --> 00:00:16,344
Not one coronation.

12
00:00:16,364 --> 00:00:18,687
Forever breaks every
rule built for death.

13
00:00:18,707 --> 00:00:20,212
Four fixes are easy.

14
00:00:20,232 --> 00:00:21,730
The fifth is the
twist.

15
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:23,165
One:
inheritance.

16
00:00:23,185 --> 00:00:24,453
Heirs inherit at
fifty,

17
00:00:24,473 --> 00:00:25,516
not at a funeral.

18
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:26,391
Two:
power.

19
00:00:26,411 --> 00:00:28,541
Her crown is lent:
a new council every

20
00:00:28,561 --> 00:00:29,329
century.

21
00:00:29,349 --> 00:00:30,347
Three:
marriage.

22
00:00:30,367 --> 00:00:31,784
She outlives every
husband,

23
00:00:31,804 --> 00:00:33,621
so vows last one
lifetime.

24
00:00:33,641 --> 00:00:34,707
Four:
family.

25
00:00:34,727 --> 00:00:36,557
Forty generations of
princes?

26
00:00:36,577 --> 00:00:38,424
Titles stop at
grandchildren.

27
00:00:38,444 --> 00:00:39,209
Run it again.

28
00:00:39,229 --> 00:00:40,546
The valley keeps
changing.

29
00:00:40,566 --> 00:00:41,465
She doesn't.

30
00:00:41,485 --> 00:00:42,140
Rule five?

31
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:42,877
Memory.

32
00:00:42,897 --> 00:00:44,840
Nobody else
remembers year zero.

33
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,727
So history is
whatever she says.

34
00:00:46,747 --> 00:00:48,267
Unless it's written
down.

35
00:00:48,287 --> 00:00:50,080
A library she can't
rewrite.

36
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,751
Immortality isn't a
trait.

37
00:00:51,771 --> 00:00:53,089
It's a society.

38
00:00:53,109 --> 00:00:54,814
Would you want an
immortal ruler?

39
00:00:54,834 --> 00:00:55,987
Explain why.

40
00:00:56,007 --> 00:00:57,626
Part 29 of 50.

41
00:00:57,646 --> 00:00:59,514
Follow for part 30:
they pray to a

42
00:00:59,534 --> 00:01:00,689
monster.
